  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAPSLOC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity for Sustained Locally-Led Development is to increase the capacity and resilience of Akhuryan consolidated community to lead its development. The project will achieve the goal through the following objectives: Objective 1: to strengthen capacity and commitment of Akhuryan community to lead their development through continuous learning, identifying and responding to local priorities; Objective 2: to enhance citizen engagement and oversight in decision making process of Akhuryan community through mobilizing settlements, equipping them with participatory decision-making and monitoring tools.</narrative>
  </description>
